      "before": "kpk1-l00-b-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Words of the classroom"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A Polish noun has a gender, and its ending usually shows it. *Tekst* and *dialog* end in a consonant: masculine. *Lekcja* and *strona* end in *-a*: feminine. *Ćwiczenie* and *polecenie* end in *-e*: neuter. You will need the gender soon, so learn each word with it."
      }
    }
  ],
